<title>FRANCE: Carbone Larraine 1st half net doubles.</title>
<headline>Carbone Larraine 1st half net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half of 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable				62  vs		30</p>
<p>    Turnover				     1,567  vs    up 40 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carbone Lorraine, a unit of Pechiney, said in a statement it expected a significant improvement in year results. It said profits increased despite certain non-recurring exceptional charges of 11 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
